Rule 3 (inputs must have the same, supported numeric dtype)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= (1 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 8) ∧ dtype_(v_2) = dtype_(v_1)
>>
Rule 4 (broadcasting-compatible shapes for elementwise comparison)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) ≥ ndim(v_2) then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : (shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - ndim(v_2) + i) = shape(v_2, i)) ∨ (shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - ndim(v_2) + i) = 1) ∨ (shape(v_2, i) = 1) else ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : (shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - ndim(v_1) + i) = shape(v_1, i)) ∨ (shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - ndim(v_1) + i) = 1) ∨ (shape(v_1, i) = 1)
